        "name": "tbrasselle",
        "email": "tbrasselle@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-11-22T15:43:46Z"
      },
      "message": "test(multiaxis): pin the off-origin rotary refusal for two rotaries and a vertical pivot\n\n#3248: two test-only cases in first_traverse_posed.rs. One: a\ntwo-work-rotary rig (A and B on the table) with A's pivot off the WCS\norigin refuses by name, and a zero pivot reads the sphere as before.\nTwo: a work-turning rotary C (vertical line) with a stated pivot is not\nrefused, with or without the pivot, so the posed law drops out by\ndesign.\n\nlaid_bar_on now takes the rig and returns the refusal as Err, like\ncontour5d_on; laid_bar_on_two_rotaries keeps the panicking wrapper.\n\nFixes #3248",
      "tree": {
